msgid "This browser will not set up notifications. If you are using a private or incognito window, open the portal normally and try again."
msgstr "Hindi kayang mag-set up ng notifications ang browser na ito. Kung naka-private o incognito window ka, buksan ang portal nang normal at subukan ulit."

